  "capturedText": "Zwetschgenkuchen\nMakes one 26 cm tart; about 12 slices\n\nFor the dough:\n250 g flour\n125 g butter, cold\n1 egg\n\nFor the topping:\n1 kg plums, halved\n2 tbsp sugar\n1 tsp cinnamon\n\nDough:\nRub the butter into the flour, add the egg, and chill for 30 minutes.\nPress into the tin.\n\nTopping:\nArrange the plums on the dough, scatter the sugar and cinnamon, and bake for 40 minutes at 190 degrees.",
